<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>TITAN VPN - V3</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Fira+Code:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#09090b;--bg-2:#111113;--bg-card:#18181b;--bg-card-h:#1f1f23;--emerald:#10b981;--emerald-soft:rgba(16,185,129,0.1);--emerald-glow:rgba(16,185,129,0.25);--white:#fafafa;--gray:#a1a1aa;--gray2:#71717a;--gray3:#52525b;--border:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);--border-2:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);--r:12px}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--white);overflow-x:hidden}
body::before{content:'';position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;opacity:.03;background-image:url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E")}
.container{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;position:relative;z-index:1}
section{padding:96px 0}
nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;padding:12px 0;backdrop-filter:blur(24px);background:rgba(9,9,11,0.88);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.nav-in{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;text-decoration:none}
.logo-mark{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:6px;object-fit:contain}
.logo-name{font-weight:800;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--white)}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:24px;list-style:none}
.nav-links a{color:var(--gray2);text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;transition:color .3s}
.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--emerald)}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;padding:9px 20px;border-radius:8px;font-family:'Manrope';font-size:13px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;border:none;transition:all .25s;text-decoration:none}
.btn-o{background:transparent;color:var(--gray);border:1.5px solid var(--border-2)}.btn-o:hover{color:var(--white)}
.btn-g{background:var(--emerald);color:white;box-shadow:0 2px 16px var(--emerald-glow)}.btn-g:hover{box-shadow:0 4px 24px var(--emerald-glow);transform:translateY(-1px)}
.btn-lg{padding:14px 32px;font-size:14px}.btn-xl{padding:16px 40px;font-size:15px;border-radius:10px}

.hero{min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;padding-top:70px;position:relative}
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:center}
.hero-text{text-align:left}
.hero-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:6px 6px 6px 8px;border:1px solid var(--border-2);border-radius:50px;margin-bottom:24px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}
.hero-chip-text{font-size:12px;color:var(--gray);font-weight:500}
.hero-chip-badge{background:var(--emerald-soft);color:var(--emerald);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:50px}
.hero h1{font-size:48px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-2px;margin-bottom:18px}
.hero h1 .hl{position:relative;display:inline-block}
.hero h1 .hl::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:4px;left:0;right:0;height:10px;background:var(--emerald);opacity:.15;border-radius:2px;z-index:-1}
.hero-p{font-size:16px;color:var(--gray);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:32px;max-width:460px}
.hero-btns{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:40px}
.hero-metrics{display:flex;gap:32px}
.metric{position:relative;padding-left:16px}.metric::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;top:4px;bottom:4px;width:2px;background:var(--emerald);border-radius:2px}
.metric-num{font-family:'Fira Code';font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:var(--emerald)}
.metric-lbl{font-size:11px;color:var(--gray2);margin-top:2px}

/* === APP MOCKUP VISUAL === */
.hero-visual{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;position:relative;min-height:480px}
.phone{width:260px;background:#f5f0ff;border-radius:32px;border:2px solid rgba(120,80,200,0.2);padding:0;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 0 80px rgba(120,80,200,0.08);position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:flex}
/* sidebar */
.ph-sidebar{width:44px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#6c3fc5 0%,#4a2a8a 100%);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:16px 0 12px;gap:18px;flex-shrink:0}
.ph-sidebar .sb-logo{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px}
.ph-sidebar .sb-icon{width:28px;height:28px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s}
.ph-sidebar .sb-icon:hover,.ph-sidebar .sb-icon.active{color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15)}
/* main area */
.ph-main{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:18px 14px 14px}
.ph-brand{font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:#4a2a8a;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.ph-brand .brand-icon{color:#c0a0ff;font-size:12px}
/* power button */
.power-ring{width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:50%;border:4px solid #e8b4b8;background:#fff;margin:0 auto 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(200,100,120,0.15);cursor:pointer;transition:all .4s}
.power-ring:hover{border-color:var(--emerald);box-shadow:0 4px 32px rgba(16,185,129,0.25)}
.power-ring:hover .power-icon{color:var(--emerald)}
.power-ring:hover ~ .ph-conn-status{color:var(--emerald)}
.power-icon{font-size:36px;color:#e07080;transition:color .4s}
.ph-conn-status{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#e05060;margin-bottom:14px;transition:color .4s}
/* server select */
.ph-server-sel{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px;margin-bottom:10px}
.ph-flag{font-size:24px}
.ph-server-name{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#4a2a8a}
.ph-server-btn{padding:8px 32px;border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7c4dff,#6c3fc5);color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border:none;cursor:pointer;margin-bottom:12px;letter-spacing:0.5px;transition:transform .2s}
.ph-server-btn:hover{transform:scale(1.04)}
/* protocol section */
.ph-proto{width:100%;border-top:1px solid rgba(120,80,200,0.12);padding-top:10px}
.ph-proto-title{text-align:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#4a2a8a;margin-bottom:8px}
.ph-proto-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:4px 10px}
.ph-proto-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#555}
.ph-proto-item .proto-check{width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;border:1.5px solid #ccc;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:8px;color:transparent;flex-shrink:0}
.ph-proto-item .proto-check.on{background:#6c3fc5;border-color:#6c3fc5;color:#fff}
/* chat badge */
.ph-chat{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;margin-top:10px;font-size:10px;color:#888;font-weight:600}
.ph-chat .chat-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#f5a623}

.mock-badge{position:absolute;padding:8px 14px;background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--gray);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)}
.mb-dot{width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--emerald);box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--emerald-glow)}
.mb-1{top:30px;right:-60px;animation:fbob 4s ease-in-out infinite}
.mb-2{bottom:50px;left:-50px;animation:fbob 5s ease-in-out infinite 1s}
@keyframes fbob{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-6px)}}

/* === FEATURES SECTION === */
.features{background:var(--bg-2)}
.section-header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:64px}
.section-chip{display:inline-block;padding:4px 14px;border-radius:50px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--emerald);background:var(--emerald-soft);margin-bottom:16px;letter-spacing:1px}
.section-header h2{font-size:36px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-1px;margin-bottom:12px}
.section-header p{color:var(--gray);font-size:15px;max-width:500px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.6}
.feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}
.feat-card{background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);padding:28px 24px;transition:all .3s}
.feat-card:hover{background:var(--bg-card-h);border-color:var(--border-2);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.feat-icon{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--emerald-soft);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:16px}
.feat-card h3{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px}
.feat-card p{font-size:13px;color:var(--gray);line-height:1.6}

/* === SERVERS SECTION === */
.servers{}
.server-tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:40px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.server-tab{padding:8px 20px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--border);background:transparent;color:var(--gray);transition:all .25s}
.server-tab:hover{color:var(--white)}
.server-tab.active{background:var(--emerald);color:white;border-color:var(--emerald)}
.server-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:12px}
.server-card{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px 18px;background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);transition:all .3s}
.server-card:hover{border-color:var(--border-2);background:var(--bg-card-h)}
.sc-left{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.sc-flag{font-size:20px}
.sc-name{font-size:13px;font-weight:600}
.sc-isp{font-size:11px;color:var(--gray2)}
.sc-right{text-align:right}
.sc-ping{font-family:'Fira Code';font-size:12px;font-weight:600}
.sc-ping.fast{color:var(--emerald)}.sc-ping.mid{color:#f59e0b}.sc-ping.slow{color:#ef4444}
.sc-status{font-size:10px;color:var(--gray3)}

/* === PRICING SECTION === */
.pricing{background:var(--bg-2)}
.price-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto}
.price-card{background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:32px 28px;text-align:center;transition:all .3s;position:relative}
.price-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:var(--border-2)}
.price-card.pop{border-color:var(--emerald);box-shadow:0 0 40px rgba(16,185,129,0.1)}
.price-pop-badge{position:absolute;top:-12px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:var(--emerald);color:white;padding:4px 16px;border-radius:50px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700}
.price-period{font-size:13px;color:var(--gray);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:16px}
.price-amount{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:4px}
.price-amount span{font-size:16px;font-weight:500;color:var(--gray)}
.price-monthly{font-size:12px;color:var(--gray2);margin-bottom:24px}
.price-features{list-style:none;text-align:left;margin-bottom:28px}
.price-features li{padding:6px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--gray);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.price-features li::before{content:'✓';color:var(--emerald);font-weight:700;font-size:12px}

/* === DOWNLOAD SECTION === */
.download{}
.dl-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px;max-width:800px;margin:0 auto}
.dl-card{background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);padding:28px 20px;text-align:center;transition:all .3s;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;color:var(--white)}
.dl-card:hover{background:var(--bg-card-h);border-color:var(--border-2);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.dl-icon{font-size:32px;margin-bottom:12px}
.dl-card h4{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px}
.dl-card p{font-size:11px;color:var(--gray2)}

/* === FAQ SECTION === */
.faq{background:var(--bg-2)}
.faq-list{max-width:700px;margin:0 auto}
.faq-item{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);margin-bottom:8px;overflow:hidden;transition:border-color .3s}
.faq-item:hover{border-color:var(--border-2)}
.faq-q{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 20px;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;transition:background .3s}
.faq-q:hover{background:var(--bg-card)}
.faq-q span{color:var(--gray2);transition:transform .3s;font-size:18px}
.faq-item.open .faq-q span{transform:rotate(45deg)}
.faq-a{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease}
.faq-item.open .faq-a{max-height:200px}
.faq-a-in{padding:0 20px 16px;font-size:13px;color:var(--gray);line-height:1.7}

/* === FOOTER === */
footer{padding:48px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.footer-in{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.footer-copy{font-size:12px;color:var(--gray3)}
.footer-links{display:flex;gap:20px}
.footer-links a{font-size:12px;color:var(--gray2);text-decoration:none;transition:color .3s}
.footer-links a:hover{color:var(--emerald)}

@media(max-width:768px){
  .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero-visual{display:none}
  .hero-text{text-align:center}.hero h1{font-size:34px}
  .hero-p{margin:0 auto 32px}.hero-btns{justify-content:center}
  .hero-metrics{justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px}
  .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .price-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .dl-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .footer-in{flex-direction:column;gap:16px;text-align:center}
  .nav-links{display:none}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ===== NAV ===== -->
<nav><div class="nav-in">
  <a href="/v3" class="logo"><img src="/static/new/img/titan.png" alt="TITAN VPN" class="logo-mark"><span class="logo-name">TITAN VPN</span></a>
  <ul class="nav-links"><li><a href="#features">기능</a></li><li><a href="#servers">서버</a></li><li><a href="#pricing">가격</a></li><li><a href="#download">다운로드</a></li><li><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></li></ul>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:8px"><a href="/login" class="btn btn-o">로그인</a><a href="/regist" class="btn btn-g">가입하기</a></div>
</div></nav>

<!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
<section class="hero">
<div class="container">
<div class="hero-grid">
  <div class="hero-text">
    <div class="hero-chip"><span class="hero-chip-text">VPN Service for Korea &amp; China</span><span class="hero-chip-badge">v3.0</span></div>
    <h1>안전하고 빠른 인터넷<br><span class="hl">TITAN VPN</span>과 함께</h1>
    <p class="hero-p">한국 KT·SK·LG 전용 서버와 해외 거점을 통해 어디서든 자유로운 인터넷을 경험하세요. 군사급 암호화로 보안까지.</p>
    <div class="hero-btns">
      <a href="#pricing" class="btn btn-g btn-xl">요금제 선택하기 →</a>
      <a href="#download" class="btn btn-o btn-lg">다운로드</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-metrics">
      <div class="metric"><div class="metric-num">41+</div><div class="metric-lbl">서버</div></div>
      <div class="metric"><div class="metric-num">99.9%</div><div class="metric-lbl">업타임</div></div>
      <div class="metric"><div class="metric-num">6</div><div class="metric-lbl">동시접속</div></div>
      <div class="metric"><div class="metric-num">4</div><div class="metric-lbl">플랫폼</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-visual">
    <div class="phone">
      <!-- Sidebar -->
      <div class="ph-sidebar">
        <div class="sb-logo">✦</div>
        <div class="sb-icon active">👤</div>
        <div class="sb-icon">🔒</div>
        <div class="sb-icon">📋</div>
        <div class="sb-icon">⬇</div>
        <div class="sb-icon" style="margin-top:auto">➡</div>
      </div>
      <!-- Main content -->
      <div class="ph-main">
        <div class="ph-brand"><span class="brand-icon">✦</span> TitanVPN</div>
        <div class="power-ring" id="powerBtn">
          <span class="power-icon">⏻</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ph-conn-status" id="connStatus">연결안됨</div>
        <div class="ph-server-sel">
          <span class="ph-flag">🇰🇷</span>
          <span class="ph-server-name">서버자동매치</span>
        </div>
        <button class="ph-server-btn">서버변경</button>
        <div class="ph-proto">
          <div class="ph-proto-title">연결방식</div>
          <div class="ph-proto-grid">
            <div class="ph-proto-item"><span class="proto-check on">✓</span>IKEV2</div>
            <div class="ph-proto-item"><span class="proto-check"></span>SSTP</div>
            <div class="ph-proto-item"><span class="proto-check"></span>OpenVPN</div>
            <div class="ph-proto-item"><span class="proto-check"></span>V2ray</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ph-chat"><span class="chat-dot"></span> 실시간 상담</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mock-badge mb-1"><span class="mb-dot"></span>AES-256 암호화</div>
    <div class="mock-badge mb-2"><span class="mb-dot"></span>V2Ray 프로토콜</div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- ===== FEATURES ===== -->
<section class="features" id="features">
<div class="container">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-chip">FEATURES</div>
    <h2>왜 TITAN VPN인가?</h2>
    <p>중국에서도 안정적인 접속, 한국 전용 서버, 다양한 프로토콜 지원</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feat-grid">
    <div class="feat-card"><div class="feat-icon">🛡️</div><h3>군사급 암호화</h3><p>AES-256 암호화와 IKEv2, OpenVPN, V2Ray 등 다양한 프로토콜로 안전한 접속.</p></div>
    <div class="feat-card"><div class="feat-icon">🇰🇷</div><h3>한국 전용 서버</h3><p>KT, SK, LG 각 통신사 직결 서버로 최적의 속도와 안정성을 제공합니다.</p></div>
    <div class="feat-card"><div class="feat-icon">⚡</div><h3>초고속 연결</h3><p>41개 이상의 서버로 부하를 분산하여 항상 빠른 속도를 유지합니다.</p></div>
    <div class="feat-card"><div class="feat-icon">🌏</div><h3>해외 서버</h3><p>일본, 미국, 인도 서버를 통해 글로벌 콘텐츠에도 자유롭게 접근하세요.</p></div>
    <div class="feat-card"><div class="feat-icon">📱</div><h3>모든 기기 지원</h3><p>Android, iOS, Windows, macOS 전용 앱으로 어디서든 간편하게 연결.</p></div>
    <div class="feat-card"><div class="feat-icon">🔄</div><h3>자동 서버 선택</h3><p>사용자 위치와 통신사를 분석하여 가장 빠른 서버를 자동으로 연결합니다.</p></div>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- ===== SERVERS ===== -->
<section class="servers" id="servers">
<div class="container">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-chip">SERVERS</div>
    <h2>글로벌 서버 네트워크</h2>
    <p>한국 3대 통신사 + 해외 거점, 총 41개 이상 서버 운영</p>
  </div>
  <div class="server-tabs">
    <button class="server-tab active" onclick="filterServers('all')">전체</button>
    <button class="server-tab" onclick="filterServers('kt')">KT</button>
    <button class="server-tab" onclick="filterServers('sk')">SK</button>
    <button class="server-tab" onclick="filterServers('lg')">LG</button>
